  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b968da625e3936f9364a60f4ec3bdc8f1d4b1d1db9850270d1f3b4f0822dfd51.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n**1) − × ÷ +**\n\n→ 17 - 7 × **12 ÷ 6** + 2 = 119\n\n→ 17 - **7 ****× 2** + 2 = 119\n\n→ **17** - 14 **+**** 2** = 119\n\n→ 19 - 14 ≠ 119\n\n→ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\n**2) + × − ÷**\n\n→ 17 + 7 × 12 - **6 ÷ 2** = 119\n\n→ 17 + **7 ****×**** 12** - 3 = 119\n\n→ **17 + 84** - 3 = 119\n\n→ 101 ≠ 119\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n3) **× − ÷ +**\n\n→ 17 × 7 - **12 ÷ 6** + 2 = 119\n\n→ **17 ****× 7** - 2 + 2 = 119\n\n→ **119** - 2 **+**** 2** = 119\n\n→ 121 - 2 = 119\n\n→ 119 = 119\n\n→ **LHS = RHS ****⇒** **Satisfies the logic.**\n\n**4) + ÷ × −**\n\n→ 17 + **7 ÷ 12** × 6 - 2 = 119\n\n→ 17 + **7/12 ×**** 6** - 2 = 119\n\n→ **17 + 7/2** - 2 = 119\n\n→ 41/2 - 2 = 119\n\n→ 37/2 ≠ 119\n\n→ **LHS** ≠ RHS\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 3 satisfies the logic.\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"****× − ÷ +\"**.",
